          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78402,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengontrol berapa kali perulangan <code>while</code> diulang, kita mulai dengan variabel yang diatur ke sebuah angka. Kita menyebut variabel ini <strong>variabel penghitung</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lalu, kita menggunakan perbandingan dalam kondisi untuk membandingkan variabel counter dengan sebuah angka. Dalam hal ini, <code>counter &lt; 4:</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>counter</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&lt;</code>, lalu <code>4</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan perbandingan dalam kondisi untuk membandingkan variabel counter dengan angka.</p><p>Jalankan loop selama counter kurang dari <code>4</code>. Letakkan <code>counter</code> di kiri dan angka di kanan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>counter</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&lt;</code>, <code>4</code>, dan terakhir <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "While Loops",
            "id": 78389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam blok kode, kita membuat kondisi mengembalikan <code>False</code> dan menghentikan loop dengan menaikkan nilai variabel penghitung.</p><p>Dalam kasus ini, <code>+=</code> menambah nilai variabel <code>counter</code> sebesar <code>1</code> setiap kali loop berjalan. Coba dengan <code>counter += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>counter += 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the condition",
            "id": 78386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengubah kondisi memberi tahu loop kapan harus berhenti. Misalnya, mengubah kondisi menjadi <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"31\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengubah nilai variabel counter mengubah kapan loop dimulai. Misalnya, menetapkan <code>counter</code> ke <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code in the code block",
            "id": 78387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Urutan kode memengaruhi apa yang ditampilkan konsol. Tempatkan <code>counter += 1</code> terlebih dahulu untuk menampilkan <code>6</code> hingga <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>counter += 1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>print(counter)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Urutan kedua baris menentukan yang ditampilkan. Susun agar loop menampilkan <code>6</code> sampai <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"65\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>counter += 1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>print(counter)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 78384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa nama variabel yang kita gunakan untuk menghitung berapa kali loop berulang?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variabel penghitung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variabel pelacak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variabel penghitung.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang digunakan untuk menghitung berapa kali loop berulang disebut variabel penghitung.</p><p><code>repeats</code> dimulai pada <code>0</code> dan bertambah setiap kali. Nilai mana yang merupakan counter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repeats</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Batas tetap loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Jumlah yang ditambahkan setiap kali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>repeats</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 78383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa kondisi dari loop <code>while</code> ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ekspresi mana yang diperiksa Python sebelum setiap pengulangan loop ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>counter &lt; 10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter += 1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(counter)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>counter &lt; 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing the counter",
            "id": 78382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan <code>counter += 1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini meningkatkan <code>counter</code> sebanyak satu setiap kali loop menjalankan blok kodenya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini membuat variabel counter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini meningkatkan <code>counter</code> sebanyak satu setiap kali loop menjalankan blok kodenya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa <code>counter += 1</code> membantu loop ini akhirnya berhenti?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menaikkan <code>counter</code> hingga <code>counter &lt; 10</code> menjadi <code>False</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mengatur ulang <code>counter</code> ke <code>1</code> setelah setiap pengulangan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Membuat variabel <code>counter</code> baru di dalam loop.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menaikkan <code>counter</code> hingga <code>counter &lt; 10</code> menjadi <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the condition",
            "id": 78381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Angka <code>1</code> sampai <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Angka <code>1</code> sampai <code>10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Angka <code>1</code> sampai <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa loop ini menampilkan <code>4</code>, tetapi bukan <code>5</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pada <code>5</code>, kondisi <code>counter &lt; 5</code> bernilai <code>False</code> sebelum blok berjalan.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python otomatis menghentikan setiap loop setelah empat pengulangan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pembaruan mengubah <code>counter</code> langsung dari <code>4</code> menjadi <code>6</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pada <code>5</code>, kondisi <code>counter &lt; 5</code> bernilai <code>False</code> sebelum blok berjalan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Changing the counter variable",
            "id": 78380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(speed)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  speed += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Angka <code>2</code> sampai <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Angka <code>1</code> sampai <code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Angka <code>2</code> sampai <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika baris pertama diubah menjadi <code>speed = 3</code>, angka mana yang ditampilkan loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(speed)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  speed += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> hingga <code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code> hingga <code>4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code> hingga <code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>3</code> hingga <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
